    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CSR-04 | Support Follow-up Queue\n\nPurpose\nMaintain a queue of tickets that need support attention.\n\nFlow\nRead support tickets → check current status\n→ add or update active cases\n→ mark existing entries Inactive when attention\nis no longer required.\n\nQueue records are matched by ticket_id.\nExisting records are retained for reference.\n\nDemo scope\nRun manually to refresh the queue.\nThis workflow tracks cases; it does not send follow-up\nemails or resolve tickets.\n\n**Author: Maha**\nAI automation and product focused roles",
        "height": 336,
        "width": 432
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -608,
        -272
      ],
      "id": "82198451-4abc-40b1-b249-48cbe5a86e18",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Identify Cases Needing Attention\n\nRead the current support tickets.\n\nInclude a ticket when processing_status is:\n• ERROR\n• NEEDS_REVIEW\n• NEEDS_REVISION\n• SEND_REVIEW_REQUIRED\n\nAlso include tickets whose resolution_status\nis Needs Follow-up.\n\nMatching tickets go to the Active queue branch.\nOther tickets go to the existing-entry check.",
        "height": 304,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        16,
        -464
      ],
      "id": "a6c46a71-0b74-444f-951c-416fedc4615e",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Add or Refresh Active Cases\n\nCopy the ticket details, current statuses,\ncustomer message, and error message into the queue.\n\nMatch records by ticket_id:\n• Add an entry if none exists.\n• Update the matching entry if it already exists.\n\nSet queue_status to Active and refresh last_refreshed_at.\n\nRepeated sequential runs update the same ticket entry.\nPreviously inactive cases become Active again\nwhen they need support attention.",
        "height": 256,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        656,
        -512
      ],
      "id": "b7af7a3e-629b-4336-80d9-e417bf16ca06",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Retire Cases From the Active Queue\n\nFor tickets that no longer meet the attention criteria,\nlook for an existing queue entry by ticket_id.\n\nIf an entry exists:\n• Set queue_status to Inactive.\n• Copy the current processing and resolution statuses.\n• Refresh last_refreshed_at.\n\nIf no entry exists, leave the queue unchanged.\n\nKeep inactive records for reference.\nThe sheet filter shows only Active cases.\n\nTickets deleted from Support_Tickets are not\nautomatically marked Inactive by this workflow.",
        "height": 304,
        "width": 464
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        672,
        144
      ],
      "id": "ac769c57-f8ce-45c0-8420-3925c4a66384",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    }
  ],
